---
import Base from "../../layouts/Base.astro";
import { Image } from "astro:assets";
import nozHero from "../../assets/work/noz/noz-hero.jpg";
import nozProduct from "../../assets/work/noz/noz-product.png";

const tags = ["Digital Marketing", "Shopify", "SEO", "Copywriting", "Brand Strategy", "CRO"];

const palette = [
  { hex: "#FFFEF4", name: "Cream background" },
  { hex: "#081411", name: "Near-black text" },
  { hex: "#D8453F", name: "Red buttons" },
];

const keywords = [
  "reef safe sunscreen",
  "zinc oxide sunscreen",
  "biodegradable sunscreen",
  "eco-friendly sunscreen",
  "best sunscreen for nose",
];
---

<Base
  title="Nöz: Building and Marketing a Shopify Store | Grace Joy Park"
  description="Grace Joy Park's digital marketing case study: building and marketing a Shopify storefront for Nöz, a simulated reef-safe SPF brand, through the Global Career Accelerator."
>
  <p class="back"><a href="/work">&larr; Back to Work</a></p>

  <article class="post">
    <h1>Nöz: Building and Marketing a Shopify Store</h1>
    <p class="meta muted">The Global Career Accelerator &middot; June 2026 &middot; Digital Marketing</p>

    <ul class="tags">
      {tags.map((t) => <li>{t}</li>)}
    </ul>

    <p class="note">
      Nöz is a simulated brand used for training in the Global Career Accelerator&rsquo;s
      digital marketing program. The store is a project build, not a commercial site, so
      anything below describes my work rather than real sales.
    </p>

    <figure class="store-preview">
      <div class="sp-frame">
        <div class="sp-banner">Free shipping on all orders over $25. Use code NOZSHIP at checkout.</div>
        <div
          class="sp-hero"
          style={`background-image: linear-gradient(rgba(20,23,20,0.45), rgba(20,23,20,0.55)), url(${nozHero.src});`}
        >
          <div class="sp-wordmark">N&Ouml;Z</div>
          <p class="sp-subcopy">
            Our neon reef-safe SPF shades are going quick this summer. Grab yours before
            they sell out and get free shipping on orders over $25.
          </p>
          <p class="sp-headline">Your shade is selling fast.</p>
          <span class="sp-cta">PICK YOUR SHADE</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <figcaption>
        The Nöz storefront hero I designed in Shopify, using the store&rsquo;s own photo,
        copy and color palette. (Store build/Grace Park)
      </figcaption>
    </figure>

    <div class="prose">
      <p class="lede">
        I built and marketed a Shopify storefront end to end for Nöz, a reef-safe, vegan
        SPF nose stick that comes in neon colors. I owned the brand positioning, site copy,
        visual choices, SEO and conversion strategy, and used the store to practice every
        stage of a digital marketing build.
      </p>

      <h2>The customer</h2>
      <p>
        I designed the store around Frances the Fashionista, the target persona from the
        Nöz brand guidelines. Frances is a fashion-forward Gen Z shopper who cares about
        self-expression, ethical products and easy sun protection. I let her priorities
        guide the copy, visuals and product positioning, so the site sells Nöz as both sun
        protection and a style statement.
      </p>

      <h2>Value proposition</h2>
      <p>
        Nöz is a reef-safe, vegan SPF nose stick in neon colors, made for shoppers like
        Frances who want their sun protection to be as bold, expressive and ethical as the
        rest of their look. I placed the value proposition in three spots so shoppers
        understand Nöz before they have to search. The hero creates urgency, a custom HTML
        block explains that the sunscreen is reef-safe, vegan and cruelty-free, and the
        featured product lets them pick a neon shade right away.
      </p>

      <h2>Brand visuals</h2>
      <p>
        I chose a cream background, near-black text and red buttons. The neutral cream keeps
        the site bright and lets the neon product colors stand out, the red feels energetic
        and playful, and the near-black text stays easy to read.
      </p>
      <ul class="swatches">
        {palette.map((c) => (
          <li>
            <span class="chip" style={`background:${c.hex}`}></span>
            <span class="chip-label">{c.name}<br /><code>{c.hex}</code></span>
          </li>
        ))}
      </ul>
      <p>
        For the hero photo I picked an image of a model wearing a neon SPF stripe on her
        nose, so Nöz reads as bold, expressive sun protection instead of plain skincare.
      </p>
      <figure class="product-figure">
        <Image
          src={nozProduct}
          alt="The Nöz reef-safe SPF nose stick"
          widths={[400, 700, 1080]}
          sizes="(max-width: 720px) 70vw, 360px"
          format="webp"
        />
        <figcaption>The Nöz product, a reef-safe SPF nose stick. (Product image/Nöz brand assets)</figcaption>
      </figure>

      <h2>SEO</h2>
      <p>
        I ran keyword research in Semrush and Google Trends, then built the homepage meta
        title around terms that balance search volume with easier-to-rank phrases. They
        match Nöz&rsquo;s reef-safe, mineral and eco-friendly positioning while reaching
        shoppers with commercial intent.
      </p>
      <ul class="keywords">
        {keywords.map((k) => <li>{k}</li>)}
      </ul>

      <h2>Conversion</h2>
      <p>
        On the landing page I focused on a handful of conversion strategies:
      </p>
      <ul class="cro">
        <li><strong>Clear CTA.</strong> The hero button reads &ldquo;PICK YOUR SHADE,&rdquo; so shoppers know the action to take.</li>
        <li><strong>Color contrast.</strong> The red CTA stands out against the darker hero image and cream background.</li>
        <li><strong>Trust badges.</strong> The product page uses eco-friendly, reef-friendly and vegan badges to reassure shoppers.</li>
        <li><strong>Whitespace.</strong> The homepage separates the hero, brand copy and featured product so the page is easy to scan.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        I also set up A/B testing and built branded email flows in Shopify, including
        promotional, abandoned-checkout and transactional sends.
      </p>
    </div>

    <section class="walkthrough-section">
      <h2>Store Walkthrough</h2>
      <div class="loom-wrap">
        <iframe
          src="https://www.loom.com/embed/d80ed8fe941248adb396409fd9e0cb7a"
          title="Nöz store walkthrough"
          frameborder="0"
          allowfullscreen
        ></iframe>
      </div>
      <p class="loom-link">
        <a href="https://www.loom.com/share/d80ed8fe941248adb396409fd9e0cb7a" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
          Watch the walkthrough on Loom &rarr;
        </a>
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="walkthrough-section">
      <h2>Store walkthrough</h2>
      <figure class="video-figure">
        <video controls preload="metadata" playsinline>
          <source src="/work/noz-walkthrough.mp4" type="video/mp4" />
          Your browser does not support inline video.
          <a href="/work/noz-walkthrough.mp4" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Download the walkthrough</a>.
        </video>
        <figcaption>A screen recording walking through the Nöz store I built. (Video/Grace Park)</figcaption>
      </figure>
    </section>

    <section class="why-section">
      <h2>What I Learned</h2>
      <p>
        The project taught me how to present one product as both a protective SPF and a
        fashion accessory, and how to keep a brand voice bold, playful and direct across a
        whole site. Building the store end to end meant the persona, the copy, the visuals,
        the SEO and the conversion choices all had to point the same direction, and seeing
        them line up is what made the work click.
      </p>
    </section>
  </article>
</Base>

<style>
  .back { margin-bottom: 1rem; font-size: 0.95rem; }

  .post h1 {
    margin-bottom: 0.6rem;
    line-height: 1.25;
  }

  .meta {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .tags {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0 0 1.5rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.4rem;
  }

  .tags li {
    border: 1px solid var(--rule);
    border-radius: 999px;
    padding: 0.15rem 0.7rem;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    color: var(--muted);
  }

  .note {
    border-left: 3px solid var(--accent);
    padding: 0.25rem 0 0.25rem 1rem;
    margin: 0 0 2rem;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .store-preview {
    margin: 0 0 2rem;
  }

  .sp-frame {
    border: 1px solid var(--rule);
    overflow: hidden;
    border-radius: 4px;
  }

  .sp-banner {
    background: #3f5170;
    color: #fff;
    text-align: center;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    padding: 0.6rem 1rem;
  }

  .sp-hero {
    background-color: #20231c;
    background-size: cover;
    background-position: center;
    color: #fff;
    text-align: center;
    padding: 3.5rem 1.5rem 4rem;
  }

  .sp-wordmark {
    font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 2rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.15em;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .sp-subcopy {
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    max-width: 36rem;
    margin: 0 auto 1.25rem;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.92);
  }

  .sp-headline {
    font-size: 2.6rem;
    line-height: 1.1;
    margin: 0 0 1.5rem;
  }

  .sp-cta {
    display: inline-block;
    background: #d8453f;
    color: #fff;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    padding: 0.85rem 1.75rem;
  }

  .store-preview figcaption {
    margin-top: 0.6rem;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-style: italic;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .walkthrough-section {
    margin-top: 2.5rem;
    padding-top: 2rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--rule);
  }

  .walkthrough-section h2 {
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
    font-size: 1.2rem;
  }

  .video-figure {
    margin: 0;
  }

  .video-figure video {
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    display: block;
    border: 1px solid var(--rule);
    background: #000;
  }

  .video-figure figcaption {
    margin-top: 0.6rem;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-style: italic;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .prose p {
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin: 0 0 1rem;
  }

  .prose .lede {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
  }

  .prose h2 {
    margin: 2rem 0 0.75rem;
    font-size: 1.2rem;
  }

  .swatches {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0 0 1.5rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 1.25rem;
  }

  .swatches li {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.6rem;
  }

  .chip {
    width: 2.5rem;
    height: 2.5rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--rule);
    border-radius: 4px;
    display: block;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .chip-label {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--muted);
    line-height: 1.4;
  }

  .chip-label code {
    font-size: 0.8rem;
  }

  .product-figure {
    margin: 0 auto 1.5rem;
    max-width: 360px;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .product-figure :global(img) {
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    display: block;
    border: 1px solid var(--rule);
  }

  .product-figure figcaption {
    margin-top: 0.6rem;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-style: italic;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .keywords {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0 0 1.5rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.4rem;
  }

  .keywords li {
    border: 1px solid var(--rule);
    border-radius: 999px;
    padding: 0.2rem 0.8rem;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    background: #f3efe6;
  }

  .cro {
    margin: 0 0 1rem;
    padding-left: 1.25rem;
  }

  .cro li {
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .why-section {
    margin-top: 2.5rem;
    padding-top: 2rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--rule);
  }

  .why-section h2 {
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    font-size: 1.2rem;
  }

  .why-section p {
    margin: 0;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }
</style>
